  "body": "**Original comment by Yuri Vic (Bitbucket: [Yuri Vic](https://bitbucket.org/Yuri Vic), ).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nBased on the manpage [https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man2/waitid.2.html](https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man2/waitid.2.html) Linux also requires inclusion of\n\n```\n       #include <sys/types.h>\n       #include <sys/wait.h>\n```\n\nfor WIFEXITED, WEXITSTATUS, etc.\n\n‌\n\nIf it doesn’t complain during compilation - it passes it by luck because these headers happen to be included elsewhere.\n\n‌\n",
